{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年29歲的內地頂流男星王一博與富家千金綦美合的緋聞流傳多年，近日再度因一款運動手環應用程式而掀起熱議。</p><p>王一博於今年8月拍攝雜誌封面時，曾在拍攝花絮中自爆，自己佩戴運動手環已「700多天，兩年」，期間僅因手部受傷而短暫摘下，手部康復後又重新</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T18:21:38.719137+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T18:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T18:14:54.837131+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T18:14:54.837131+00:00","content_hash":"edd78323d3fee30f6bc5e2a1ba364b36024f36c732d6ff0ebc4d9cf94749341c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}